# delayed_convolution_relay_neuron.nestml
# ########################################
#
#
# Description
# +++++++++++
#
# Postsynaptic partner for ``delayed_convolution_synapse`` in the tests. It emits a spike whenever it receives one with a weight
# of at least 0.5, so that its spike times can be set from a spike generator; spikes of weight 0 (from the synapse under test)
# are ignored.
#
#
# Copyright statement
# +++++++++++++++++++
#
# This file is part of NEST.
